        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Part of a ladies dressing bag T.1 to T.1EEE-1984 (59 parts). \nThe frame contains the comb (part c), brush (d), sewing case (e), card case with lid (f & g) with 6 visiting cards (h to m), metal match box (n) with 6 wax vestas (o to t), an ink stand with glass ink pot (u & v), and leather case with lid (w & x)."@en .

